        <activityName xml:lang="en">District heat, at consumer, biomethane cogen 1MWth, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, biomethane cogen 1MWth, allocation exergy
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from biomethane in cogeneration plant only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. For heat from cogeneration economic allocation was used.;
Synonyms: Fernwärme, an Abnehmer, Biogas, aufbereitet in BHKW 1MWth, Allokation Exergie; 
UUID: 82fc5365-5794-3f52-8bb7-00d40539f384
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from biomethane at cogen 1MWth.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_82fc5365-5794-3f52-8bb7-00d40539f384.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
